  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 9 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nLooks Can Be Deceiving. Step Inside and Be Surprised!\r\n\r\nEnjoy stunning sea views across to Bucklands Beach and beyond, with Glendowie Park right across the road. Glendowie Primary School is an easy stroll away, as is Glendowie College.\r\n\r\nYou really need to see this home for yourself! Step inside and discover a surprisingly spacious townhouse offering generous living and excellent entertaining spaces. Ideally positioned close to Roberta Reserve and local waterfront cafés, this is a home that deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• 3 Double Bedrooms + Office/Study: Plenty of room for family, guests or working from home.\r\n\r\n• 3 Bathrooms: Two bedrooms enjoy their own ensuite, including two brand-new bathrooms.\r\n\r\n• Quality Kitchen: Functional design with premium Silestone benchtops.\r\n\r\n• Spacious Living & Sea Views: Generous open-plan living flowing to a sunny balcony with beautiful water views.\r\n\r\n• Fantastic Outdoor Entertaining: A covered courtyard and easy-care TigerTurf garden, providing the perfect setting for family Christmas gatherings and summer entertaining.\r\n\r\n• Double Garaging: Extra-large double garage with excellent storage.\r\n\r\n• Excellent Schooling: Zoned for Glendowie Primary and Glendowie College.\r\n\r\nWhether enjoying your morning coffee on the balcony, entertaining friends in the courtyard or taking a stroll across to the park, this home offers space, views and a lifestyle that's hard to beat.\r\n\r\nWhy wait? Move in before Christmas and enjoy summer in your new home!\r\n\r\nDon't judge this home from the street – step inside, you may be pleasantly surprised!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
